mote-voice-macos

Portions of this crate are adapted from the Overseer voice crate at revision
2b1a19a9b6e639628367a22e16155af20df4f86a. The source package declares the MIT license.

Derived source files:
  voice/src/mic.rs
  voice/src/calls.rs
  voice/src/recognize.rs
  voice/src/memspeech.rs
  voice/src/speak.rs
  voice/src/synth.rs

Adaptations make the code product-neutral, replace built-in vocabulary with caller data, expose
explicit lifecycle traits, add deterministic fakes, keep Whisper target-specific and return an
unavailable result on non-macOS targets. No Overseer daemon or task-runtime code is included.

The resulting crate is distributed under Mote's MIT OR Apache-2.0 license.
